{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552120/extras/1.gif?t=1741729619\" /><br><br>Enter the mysterious world of <i>S\u00e9las</i>, a challenging platformer and puzzle game where every move requires strategy and precision. Embark on an enigmatic journey through stunning environments filled with hidden secrets, clever challenges, and obstacles that will push your skills to the limit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each part has been carefully designed to test your logic and precision, combining innovative platforming mechanics with engaging puzzles.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552120/extras/2.gif?t=1741729619\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover atmospheric landscapes, rich with intriguing details and secrets waiting to be unveiled.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With every jump and puzzle solved, you get closer to the truth behind <i>S\u00e9las</i>. What lies hidden in this world? Only the most persistent will find out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every jump counts! Control your movements carefully to avoid traps and find the ideal path through challenging environments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Are you ready to face the challenges and uncover the secrets of <i>S\u00e9las</i>?<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552120/extras/3.gif?t=1741729619\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3552120?t=1741729619","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552120/ed13aeed7832a814f2d108ecb07e8db6ed9bda8d/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1741729619","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552120/868e261dda6deb505ad088710a46acea545ec1f4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1741729619","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552120/868e261dda6deb505ad088710a46acea545ec1f4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1741729619","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552120/extras/1.gif?t=1741729619\" /><br><br>Enter the mysterious world of <i>S\u00e9las</i>, a challenging platformer and puzzle game where every move requires strategy and precision. Embark on an enigmatic journey through stunning environments filled with hidden secrets, clever challenges, and obstacles that will push your skills to the limit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each part has been carefully designed to test your logic and precision, combining innovative platforming mechanics with engaging puzzles.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552120/extras/2.gif?t=1741729619\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover atmospheric landscapes, rich with intriguing details and secrets waiting to be unveiled.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With every jump and puzzle solved, you get closer to the truth behind <i>S\u00e9las</i>. What lies hidden in this world? Only the most persistent will find out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every jump counts! Control your movements carefully to avoid traps and find the ideal path through challenging environments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Are you ready to face the challenges and uncover the secrets of <i>S\u00e9las</i>?<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552120/extras/3.gif?t=1741729619\" /></p>","developers":["DougVeiraDev"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552120/89f911958c7567b2198bacd4ddf3f71077